<title>PHILIPPINES: SolidBank says Q4 net at 156.884 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>SolidBank says Q4 net at 156.884 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SolidBank Corp said on Friday it posted a net income of 156.884 million pesos in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>In documents made available to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the bank said it recorded total operating income of 1.185 billion pesos and total operating expenses of 972 million pesos in the period.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
